<h1>Profiles in HW settings</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="parameterstitle">'Name' listbox</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Shows the profile currently being used. Select a profile name from the drop-down list to apply a new alignment profile, import, view, save, or delete profile.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Import'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Imports profiles created in earlier versions of KUBE. The chosen .mmp file will be listed in the profile listbox the next time KUBE is started.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'View'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Displays the settings of the current profile.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><img src="../images/profile_info.bmp" width="338px" height="432px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Save as'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Saves the current settings in a new profile.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Delete'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Removes current profile.</p>

